<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="COL" style="id">COL- Goofa</book>
  <para style="h">Qolaasiyasa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Qola</para>
  <para style="toc2">Qolaasiyasa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosi Qolaasiyasa Asaas Xaafida Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosi Qolaasiyasa Asaas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafida Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosa Qolaasiyasa asaas xaafida kiitay xaafettiday, Guutha Iisiyan, Efesoonappe doloha baggara de7iya Qolaasiyasa kataman de7iya woosa keethaassa. He woosa keetha essiday Phawuloosa gidonna ixxikokka, Roome biittan Iisiya waanna katama gidida Efesoonappe Wonggelaa oosanchchota kiittey iya gidiya gisho, Qolaasiyasaskka aawatethi iyaw de7ees. Qolaasiyasa woosa keethan, “Xoossaa eranawunne kumetha atotethaa demmanaw asi ubbay ayyaana wolqqatasinne maatatas goynnanaw koshshees” yaagiya worddo asttamaareti de7eyssa Phawuloosi si7is. He asttamaareti tamaarssiya harabay, qassi, “Asi ubbay qaxxaro daaniya wogatas haarettanawunne katha woga ubbaa naaganaw koshshees” yaagosona.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosi ha kiitaa xaafiday tuma ammano timirttiya tamaarssidi, entta worddo timirttiya laallanaassa. I zaarida zaarotappe waannatey, “Yesuus Kiristtoosi kumetha atotethaa immees; hara haymaanotetinne oosoti iyappe haassosona” yaageyssa. Xoossay Kiristtoosa baggara alamiya medhdhis. Qassi iya baggara zaaridi baakko ehana. Ha alamiyas atotetha ufayssay de7ey Kiristtoosa ammanonna. Hessa gisho, Phawuloosi ha gita timirttey ammaniyaa asaa de7on waanidi ooson pee7anaw bessiyako odees. Ha kiitaynne Efesoona asaas xaafida kiitay ba oykkida qofaninne kiitan woli daanosona. Ha nam77u maxaafata giddon de7iya dummatethay, Efesoonan Kiristtoosi woosa keethas huu7e, Qolaasiyasan Kiristtoosi medhetethaas huu7e.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha kiitaa Phawuloosappe ekkidi Qolaasiyasa gathanaw bida Tikiqoosara issife de7ey Anasmoosa gideyssa besoy maaddiyabaa. Waanidi giikko, Phawuloosa Anasmoosa geetettiya ba oosanchchuwabaa Filmmoonas hara kiitaa xaafis.</para>
  <para style="iot">Qolaasiyasa kiitaa ayfe qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo qofaa 1:1-8</para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa kandduwanne oosuwa 1:9-2:19</para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosan de7iya ooratha de7o 2:20-4:6</para>
  <para style="io1">Wurssetha sarothonne kuushsha qofaa 4:7-18</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Xoossaa shenen Kiristtoosi Yesuusa hawaare gidida Phawuloosinne nu ishaa Ximotiyoosi, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Qolaasiyasa kataman de7iya Kiristtoosan geeshshatasinne ammanettida asaas xaafida kiitaa.</para>
  <para style="p">Xoossaa nu Aawappe aadho keehatethaynne sarotethay hinttew gido.</para>
  <para style="s">Galata woosaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nuuni hinttew woossiya wode Xoossaa nu Godaa, Yesuus Kiristtoosa Aawa ubba wode galatoos. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nuuni Kiristtoos Yesuusan de7iya hintte ammanuwanne geeshshata ubbaas de7iya hintte siiquwa si7ida. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessa hintte oothiday hintte ufayssay salon hinttew naagettida gishossa. Hintte tuma kiitta gidida Wonggelaa koyro ammanida wode he ufayssaa si7ideta. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hintte he Wonggelaa si7ida wodenne Xoossaa aadho keehatethaa tumaa shaakki erida wodeppe doomidi hintte giddon haanidayssada biitta ubban diccishenne ayfishe de7ees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hintte hessa nuura issife Kiristtoosas oothiya ammanettida, dosettida Ephphaafirappe tamaarideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:12">Qola 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Filmo 23</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>I hessa bolla gujjidi Ayyaanay hinttew immida siiquwabaa nuus odis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, nuuni hinttebaa si7ida gallasaappe doomidi, Xoossay ba sheniya hinttena bessana melanne, Geeshsha Ayyaanay immiya eratethaaninne cinccatetha ubban hinttena kunthana mela ubba wode hinttew Xoossaa woossos. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hessadakka, Goday koyeyssada hintte daana mela, ubba wode iya ufayssana mela, lo77o ooso ubban hintte ayfe ayfana melanne Xoossaa aathi erishe diccana mela Xoossaa woossos.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Xoossaa bonchcho wolqqay hintte ubbabaa genccanaadanne dandda7anaada ba minotethaa immidi hinttena ufaysso. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Qassi geeshshata poo7o kawotethaa laattana mela hinttena oothida Aawa galatite. <verse number="13" style="v"/>I nuna dhuma wolqqaafe ashshidi ba dosiya na7aa kawotethaako nuna ehis. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Iyan wozettidi iya suuthan nagara atotethi demmida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:7">Efe 1:7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosa dhoqqatethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi benttonna Xoossaas tuma leemiso. I medhetetha ubbaafe bayra. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ubbabay iya baggara medhettis. Benttiyabatinne benttonnabati, wolqqatinne godati, haareyssatinne maata aawati, saloninne sa7an de7iya ubbay iyawunne iya baggara medhettis. <verse number="17" style="v"/>I ubbabaappe kase de7ees. Ubbabay iyan ba bessan bessan oykettidi de7ees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>I ba asatethi gidida woosa keethas huu7e. I ubbaafe bolla gidanaw hayqoppe denddon sinthenne bayra.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:22-23">Efe 1:22-23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Xoossay ba kumetha Xoossatethaara iyan daanaw koyis. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Qassi masqaliya bolla gussida ba na7aa suuthan sarotethi medhdhidi saloninne sa7an de7iya ubbaa iya baggara baara sigethis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:16">Efe 2:16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hayssafe kase hintte qofaa iitatethay hinttena Xoossaafe shaakkisinne iyara morkke oothis; hintte oosoykka iita. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Shin ha77i Kiristtoosi ashon hayqqida hayquwa baggara Xoossay hinttena baara sigethidi, geeshshata, borey baynnayssatanne xillota oothis. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hinttee, hintte ammanuwan qaaxxonna minnidinne xaphphidi daanaw bessees. Hintte Wonggelaa qaalaa si7ida wode ekkida ufayssaa minthi oykkite. He Wonggelay hintte si7idayssanne biitta ubban sabbakettidayssa. Ta, Phawuloosikka ha Wonggelaas oosanchcho gidas.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosa hawaaretetha oosuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Taani hintte gisho ha77i ekkiya waayiyan ufayttays. Kiristtoosi iya asatethi gidida woosa keethaas ekkida waayiya taani ta ashuwan polays. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Xoossaa qaalaa hinttew polada odana mela taw imettida maatan woosa keethaas oosanchcho gidas. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ha qaalay kase aadhdhida wodiyan yeletethaa ubbaafe geemmidi de7is. Shin ha77i Xoossay ha xuuraa ammaniyaa ubbaas qonccisis. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Xoossay Ayhude gidonna asaa giddon ha xuuraa bonchcho duretethaa qonccisis. Ikka bonchcho ufayssi gidida hintte giddon de7iya Kiristtoosa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, issi issi asi Kiristtoosan kumetha asi oothidi shiishanaw cinccatetha ubban asaa tamaarssoninne zoren Kiristtoosabaa sabbakoos. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Xoossay ba gita wolqqan tanan oothiya gisho, ha77i gakkanaw iya wolqqan baaxetaysinne daaburays.</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta hinttewunne Loodoqiya kataman de7iya asaas, hessadakka tana ayfen be7iboonna asa ubbaas ay mela baaxetiyakko hintte erana mela koyays. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ta baaxetiya gaasoykka entti bantta wozanan minnidi, siiqon qashettidi, polo gidida kumetha akeeka duretethaa demmidi Xoossaa xuuraa Kiristtoosa erana melassa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Iyan Xoossay minjjida eraynne cinccatetha ubbay de7ees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ta hessa oonikka hinttena cimo qaalan balethonna mela koyada gays. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ta hinttefe haakkada de7ikkoka ayyaanan hinttera de7ays. Hintte duussaa maaranne Kiristtoosa hintte minnidi ammaneyssa be7ada ufayttays.</para>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosan de7iya kumetha de7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hintte Godaa Kiristtoos Yesuusa ekkidayssada iyan de7ite. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Iyan xapho yeddite; iyan keexettite. Hintte tamaaridayssada ammanon minnite; Xoossaas kumidi palahida galataa immite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kiristtoosappe gidonnashin, asa woganinne ha alamiya coo wogan katida timirttiyaninne asappe yida eratethan oonikka hinttena cimi balethidi di77onna mela naagettite. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Xoossaa Xoossatethay Kiristtoosa asatethan kumethi de7ees. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hintteka maatasinne wolqqa ubbaas huu7e gidiya Kiristtoosan kumideta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hintte Kiristtoosa ammanidi qaxxarettideta. Hessika asa kushen gidonnashin, hinttena iita hanotethaafe diggiya Kiristtoosan oosettida qaxxaretethi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hintte xammaqettida wode Kiristtoosara issife moogettidi, Kiristtoosa hayqoppe denthida Xoossaa wolqqaa ammanidi, Kiristtoosara issife denddideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:4">Roome 6:4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hinttee, hintte nagaraa gishonne hintte ceega asatethaa qaxxarettonna gisho hayqqidi de7ishin, Xoossay hintte nagaraa atto gis. Kiristtoosara hinttew de7o immis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:1-5">Efe 2:1-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v"/>I nuna mootiyanne nuura eqettiya, nu bolla xaafettida acuwa daakkidi masqaliya bolla dhishidi ogeppe diggis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:15">Efe 2:15</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi wolqqatanne maatata masqaliyan xoonidi, entta ola danccuwa bilisidi, di7ettida asada entta qonccen yuushshi bessis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, miyaban woykko uyiyaban, baale gallas woykko ageeni xeeriya qammaa bonchchon oonikka hintte bolla pirddofo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:1-6">Roome 14:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hayssati sinthafe yaanaw de7iyabatas eesho, shin tumay Kiristtoosaa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Qoodheppe qommo ashkketethaninne kiitanchcho goynnon ceeqettiya oonikka hinttena hintte woytuwappe ashshofo. Hessa mela asi ba be7ida qonccethan nashettishe ba asho qofan coo otorttees. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hessa mela asaas huu7e gidida Kiristtoosara gaytethi baawa. I asatetha ubbaa shayaninne kesson keson gathi oythidi muzidi dichchees. Xoossay hessa mela ogen asatetha ubbaas dichchi immees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:16">Efe 4:16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Ooratha de7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hintte Kiristtoosara hayqqidi ha alamiya haariya ayyaanata wolqqaafe la77a keyideta. Yaatin, ays shaakettonna asada gididi ha wogatas haretetii? <verse number="21" style="v"/>He wogati, “Oykkofa; laaccofa; bochchofa” geetetteyssata. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ha ubbay asa woganne timirtte gidiya gisho ooso bolla pee7idaappe guye dhayana. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ha kiitati bonchchonne cinccatethi daanidi benttanaw dandda7osona. Ha wogati Xoosse daro dosisiyaba, ashkkenne hintte asatethaa haarisiyabaa daanosona, shin nu iita amotetha bolla wolqqi enttaw baawa.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ooratha de7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hiza, hintte Kiristtoosara hayqoppe denddidayssada, Xoossaafe ushachcha baggan uttida Kiristtoosi de7iya bessan, salon de7iyabata koyite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Salon de7eyssata bolla hintte qofaa wothiteppe attin sa7an de7iyabata bolla wothofite. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hintte hayqon shaakettida mela ha alamiyappe shaakettideta. Hintte de7oy Kiristtoosara issife Xoossan geemmis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hinttew de7o gidida Kiristtoosi qoncciya wode he wode hintteka iyara bonchchon qonccana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, hinttenan de7iya alame amota wodhite. Hessatikka laymatethi, tunatethi, laymatanaw amotethi, eeqa goynno mela gidida uuzetethi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hayssata gaason Xoossaa hanqoy kiitettonna asaa bolla yaana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hintteka kase he iita ogiyan biya asaa gidon de7ishe hayssata oothideta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ha77i hintte hessata oothofite. Qassi hanqo, ixo, kachchi, zigirssinne borsso oda hinttefe diggit. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ceega asatethaa iya oosuwara hinttefe qaarida gisho, issoy issuwas worddotoppite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:22">Efe 4:22</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v"/>Xoossaa medho daaniya, eratethan laamettida ooratha asatethaa ma77ite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Medhe 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:24">Efe 4:24</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ha ooratha medhetethan, Girike asi woykko Ayhude asi, qaxxarettiday woykko qaxxarettonnay, Barbaare asi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Barbaare asi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Guussay tamaariboonna woykko eronna woykko yelettida mela si7i gidi de7iya asi guussu.</char></note> woykko Iskute asi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Iskute asi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Guusay wozana mino asi woykko wozana iita asi guussu.</char></note> aylley woykko womaannoy baawa. Kiristtoosi ubbaa; I ubban de7ees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Xoossan doorettida asada geeshshatanne dosettidayssata gididi, maarotethaa, keehatethaa, ashkketethanne dandda7a ma77ite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:2">Efe 4:2</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v"/>Issoy issuwa dandda7ite. Oonikka ba laggiyan qohettidabay de7ikko iyaw atto go. Goday hinttew atto gidayssada hintteka wolis atto giite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:32">Efe 4:32</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v"/>He ubbaa bolla ubbabaa issife shiishidi qachchiya siiqo ma77ite. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Xoossaa hinttena issi asi oothidi xeegiday, sarotethas gidiya gisho Kiristtoosa sarotethay hintte wozanaa haaro.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kiristtoosa qaalay hintte wozanan kumidi de7o. Cinccatetha ubban issoy issuwa tamaarssitenne zorite. Mazmuren, sabaninne ayyaana yethan Xoossaa wozanappe galatishe yexxite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16-17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:19-20">Efe 5:19-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Xoossaa Aawa Yesuusa baggara galatishe hintte odettiyabaa woykko oothiyabaa ubbaa Godaa Yesuusa sunthan oothite.</para>
  <para style="s">Ammaniya asaa duusaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Machcheto, ammaniyaa asaas bessiyabaa gidiya gisho, hintte azinatas haarettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Efe 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1Phexi 3:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Azinatoo, hintte machcheta siiqite; enttaw iitoppite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:25">Efe 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1Phexi 3:7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nayto, hinttena yelidayssatas ubbaban kiitettite; hessi Godaa ufayssiyabaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:1">Efe 6:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Aawato, hintte nayti ufayssi qanxonna mela entta camethofite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:4">Efe 6:4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Aylletoo, sa7an hinttew goda gididayssatas ubbaban kiitettite. Godaa bonchchishe suure wozanappe kiitettidi entta ufayssiteppe attin asi be7o gidi oothofite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:5-8">Efe 6:5-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hintte oothiya ooso ubbaa asas gidonnashin, Godaas oothiya mela wozanappe oothite. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Godaappe laata woyto oothidi hintte ekkeyssa erite; hintte Godaa Kiristtoosa haggaazeeta. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Xoossay asa som77o be7idi pirddonna gisho, oonikka iita ooso oothiko ba iita oosuwa gisho zaaro ekkana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:5-8">Efe 6:5-8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Godato, hinttewuka qassi salon Goday de7eyssa eridi, hintte aylletas xillotethaninne issuwa issuwafe shaakkonna koshshiyabaa oothite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efe 6:9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Xoossaa barkkidi galatishe qanxonna woossite. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Xoossay ba qaalas pengge dooyana melanne taani hessa gaason qashon de7iya Kiristtoosa xuuraa awaajjana mela nuuskka woossite. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Qassi takka besseyssada qaala qonccisada odana mela taw Xoossaa woossite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Injjetiya wode ubbaa go7ettishe ammanonna asaa matan cinccatethan de7ite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:16">Efe 5:16</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hintte asa ubbaas koshshiya zaaro imo erana mela hintte oday ubba wode aadho keehatethan kumidayssanne maxineda mal7iyabaa gidanaw bessees.</para>
  <para style="s">Wurssetha sarotaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nu siiqo ishay Tikiqoosi, taara issife Godaa oosuwan aylle gidida, ammanettiya oosanchchoy, ta de7uwabaa hinttew odana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Ha@O 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2Ximo 4:12</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:21-22">Efe 6:21-22</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>Taani iya hintteko kiittiday, nu waanidi de7iyakko hinttew odidi hinttena minthethana melassa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Anasmoosi, ammanettiya siiqo ishay, hintte baggay, iyara hintteko bees. Entti hayssan haniyaba ubbaa hinttew odana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:10-12">Filmo 10-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Taara qashettida Arisxirokoosinne Barnnabaasa ishaa na7ay Marqqoosi, hinttena saro yaagosona. Ta hinttew kase odidayssada Marqqoosi hintteko biikko iya mokkite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Ha@O 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27:2</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Filmo 24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:12">Ha@O 12:12</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesuusa giya Yasxxoosi hinttena saro saro yaagees. Xoossaa kawotethaa gisho taara oothiya asata giddofe Ayhude gididayssati ha heedzata; entti tana daro minthethidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hintte baggay, Kiristtoos Yesuusa aylley, Ephphaafiri hinttena saro saro yaagees. I hintte Xoossaa sinthan minnidi eqqanaadanne Xoossaa sheniya eridi polana mela ubba wode Xoossaa hintte gisho woossees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:7">Qola 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Filmo 23</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v"/>I hintte gishonne Loodoqiyaninne Hirapoolisa kataman de7iya asaa gisho daro daaburidayssa ta markkattays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nu siiqo ishay dottorey Luuqaasinne Deemasi, hinttena saro saro yaagosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:10-11">2Ximo 4:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Filmo 24</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v"/>Loodoqiyan de7iya nu ishatas, Nimfaasinne I keethan shiiqiya asaas nu sarothuwa odite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ha dabddaabbiya hintte nabbabidaappe guye, Loodoqiya woosa keethan nabbabisite. Hintteka Loodoqiya woosa keethay hinttew yeddiya dabddaabbiya nabbabite. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Qassi Arkkiphphaasa, “Goday new immida oosuwa polanayssa dogoppa” yaagidi qofisite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:2">Filmo 2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Taani, Phawuloosi, ha sarothuwa ta kushen xaafas. Ta qashuwa qoppite.</para>
  <para style="p">Xoossaa aadho keehatethay hinttera gido.</para>
  <para style="restore">02-Oct-2008@09:05, Backup Description=23-Sep-2008@16:55, Ed Owen -</para>
</usx>
